{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不再故意疏远  (No Longer Keeping Her Distance)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out on the Media College lawn after her defence, Bu Xiaogu catches up with Chun Yuqiao to apologise for avoiding him in recent weeks. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起，我不想只跟你说谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你帮了我这么多，谢谢这两个字太轻了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "用不着客气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前几天我跟董事长谈过一次心，我说你是除了父母之外对我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在才明白，当时的我究竟是在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "在我每一天的生活里，工作、学业、朋友，全都是因为你才存在的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果没有你，我都不知道以后我会变成什么样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以以后不管发生什么事，我都不应该故意疏远你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没有立场这么做，我也不想这么做。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年搜一张你的私人照特别难，现在的学生随随便便就能跟你合影。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，看这边，让我留一张合影吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那么多人看着呢，你别闹。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起，我不想只跟你说谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry—I do not want to merely say thank you to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你帮了我这么多，谢谢这两个字太轻了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have helped me so much that the words thank you feel far too light.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "用不着客气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no need for formalities.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前几天我跟董事长谈过一次心，我说你是除了父母之外对我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A few days ago I had a heart-to-heart with the chairwoman and told her that apart from my parents, you have influenced me most deeply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在才明白，当时的我究竟是在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only now do I truly understand what I meant back then.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "在我每一天的生活里，工作、学业、朋友，全都是因为你才存在的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In my everyday life, my work, my studies, and my friends all exist because of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果没有你，我都不知道以后我会变成什么样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without you, I do not even know what kind of person I would become.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以以后不管发生什么事，我都不应该故意疏远你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So whatever happens in the future, I should never deliberately distance myself from you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没有立场这么做，我也不想这么做。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no right to act that way, and I do not want to either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年搜一张你的私人照特别难，现在的学生随随便便就能跟你合影。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Years ago finding a private photo of you was so hard, yet students today can take photos with you effortlessly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，看这边，让我留一张合影吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior brother, look this way and let me keep one photo together!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那么多人看着呢，你别闹。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So many people are watching—stop fooling around.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起，我不想只跟你说谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你帮了我这么多，谢谢这两个字太轻了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "用不着客气。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "前几天我跟董事长谈过一次心，我说你是除了父母之外对我影响最深的人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我现在才明白，当时的我究竟是在说什么。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "在我每一天的生活里，工作、学业、朋友，全都是因为你才存在的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果没有你，我都不知道以后我会变成什么样子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以以后不管发生什么事，我都不应该故意疏远你。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没有立场这么做，我也不想这么做。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年搜一张你的私人照特别难，现在的学生随随便便就能跟你合影。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，看这边，让我留一张合影吧！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那么多人看着呢，你别闹。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having cleared the air with an honest promise never to shun him again, Bu Xiaogu happily poses for a campus photo beside Chun Yuqiao. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
